test = 2 lectures
```

This is leakage-safe but noisy.

Recommended for benchmark reliability:

```python
n_val = max(3, int(n * 0.10))
n_test = max(3, int(n * 0.10))
```

With 41 lectures:

```text
val = 4 lectures
test = 4 lectures
```

Use 10/10 if final benchmark quality matters more than squeezing maximum training samples.

